<title>POLAND: ESPEBEPE GROUP NET SWINGS TO LOSS IN AUG.</title>
<headline>ESPEBEPE GROUP NET SWINGS TO LOSS IN AUG.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results August</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>AUGUST</p>
<p> Net loss		 6.96 vs   0.18 profit</p>
<p> Pre-tax loss	   6.96 vs   0.25 profit</p>
<p> Operating loss	 2.01 vs   0.64 profit</p>
<p> Sales		   13.19 vs  12.15</p>
<p>JANUARY-AUGUST</p>
<p> Net loss		13.78 vs   0.52</p>
<p> Pre-tax loss	  13.77 vs   0.44</p>
<p> Operating loss	 6.28 vs   2.42</p>
<p> Sales		   70.72 vs  63.79</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish construction company is Espebepe</p>
<p>Holding SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
